  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Iconic low-top AF1 silhouette for an impeccably clean, streamlined look\n        Premium leather upper with a perforated toe box offers breathable comfort\nLeather Swoosh on the sides with pristine stitch line for signature style\nLace-up closure with a hardware AF1 lace dubrae for a snug, secure fit\n        Padded collar and foam midsole deliver elevated comfort in key areas\n        Nike Air cushioning adds lightweight, all-day comfort\n        Rubber outsole with the classic pivot-circle pattern for traction and durability\n        The Nike Air Force 1 '07 is imported\nGrounded in basketball heritage, the Men's Nike Air Force 1 '07 Casual Shoes represent the pinnacle of clean, low-profile footwear design with a legacy defined off the court. Often imitated but never duplicated, the AF1 remains the standard for everyday freshness, drawing nods from sneakerheads and casual onlookers alike. Built with a premium leather upper and signature Swoosh overlays, this game-changing silhouette gets a comfort boost from an encapsulated Nike Air cushioning unit, delivering time-tested comfort and crisp streetwear style.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's Nike Air Force 1 '07 Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/White/Light Smoke Gr